@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+**Added:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Changed:**
+
+* The ``RelativeHybridTopologyProtocol`` and ``SepTopProtocol`` now return an unbiased estimate of the standard deviation via the ``get_uncertainty`` method, reported uncertainties are expected to be larger than before. PR #2000
+
+**Deprecated:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Removed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Fixed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Security:**
+
+* <news item>
